h applications</span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://virtualosmuseum.org/images/front_page/LisaOS%203.1%20-%2002%20LisaDraw.png\" title=\"LisaOS 3.1 - 02 LisaDraw\"><img src=\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=virtualosmuseum.org/images/front_page/LisaOS%203.1%20-%2002%20LisaDraw.png&amp;w=300&amp;h=300&amp;output=png&amp;q=50&amp;t=square\" alt=\"LisaOS 3.1 - 02 LisaDraw\" title=\"LisaOS 3.1 - 02 LisaDraw\"><span>LisaOS 3.1 - 02 LisaDraw</span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://virtualosmuseum.org/images/front_page/MOS%20for%20BBC%20Master%20Compact%205.10%20(Base)%20-%2002%20Desktop.png\" title=\"MOS for BBC Master Compact 5.10 (Base) - 02 Desktop\"><img src=\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=virtualosmuseum.org/images/front_page/MOS%20for%20BBC%20Master%20Compact%205.10%20(Base)%20-%2002%20Desktop.png&amp;w=300&amp;h=300&amp;output=png&amp;q=50&amp;t=square\" alt=\"MOS for BBC Master Compact 5.10 (Base) - 02 Desktop\" title=\"MOS for BBC Master Compact 5.10 (Base) - 02 Desktop\"><span>MOS for BBC Master Compact 5.10 (Base) - 02 Desktop</span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://virtualosmuseum.org/images/front_page/Mac%20OS%20(Classic)%201.0%20alpha;%20Sony%20Test%20(System%20'7.0',%20Finder%201983-10-04)%20-%2000%20Finder.png\" title=\"Mac OS (Classic) 1.0 alpha; Sony Test (System '7.0', Finder 1983-10-04) - 00 Finder\"><img src=\"https://images.weserv.nl/?url=virtualosmuseum.org/images/front_page/Mac%20OS%20(Classic)%201.0%20alpha;%20Sony%20Test%20(System%20%277.0%27,%20Finder%201983-10-04)%20-%2000%20Finder.png&amp;w=300&amp;h=300&amp;output=png&amp;q=50&amp;t=square\" alt=\"Mac OS (Classic) 1.0 alpha; Sony Test (System '7.0', Finder 1983-10-04) - 00 Finder\" title=\"Mac OS (Classic) 1.0 alpha; Sony Test (System '7.0', Finder 1983-10-04) - 00 Finder\"><span>Mac OS (Classic) 1.0 alpha; Sony Test (System '7.0', Finder 1983-10-04) - 00 Finder</span></a></li><li><a href=\"https://virtualosmuseum.org/images/front_page/Mac%20OS%209.0.4%20-%2000%20Finder,%20Internet%20Explorer,and%20H